d":51553,"name":"Mochi"},"can_ping":true,"can_manage_projects":true,"can_manage_people":true,"can_access_timesheet":false,"can_access_hill_charts":true},"description":"\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"autolinked\" data-behavior=\"truncate\" href=\"https://invideo.io/ai-videos/?template_id=31312\u0026amp;show_preview=true\"\u003ehttps://invideo.io/ai-videos/?template_id=31312\u0026amp;show_preview=true\u003c/a\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e(00:00 – 00:03)\u003cbr\u003eAudio: Ambient city sounds fade, then a click as she presses play.\u003cbr\u003eVisuals: 16:9 wide shot. A young white woman in late teens, full body visible in the lower third, walking steadily in side-profile (left to right), centered in frame. Earphones on, phone in hand. Neutral American city street background, muted tones, soft daylight. Flat tracking shot.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e(00:03 – 00:07)\u003cbr\u003eAudio: Rock guitars + drums crash in.\u003cbr\u003eVisuals: Match cut, woman retains exact position and proportions. Background transforms into a rock concert stage — flashing red/black lights, crowd silhouettes with hands raised, smoky air. She now wears a leather jacket + boots. Cinematic surreal realism, gritty textures, strobe flashes.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e(00:07 – 00:11)\u003cbr\u003eAudio: Transition click → pulsating electronic beat.\u003cbr\u003eVisuals: Same framing. Background shifts into a cyberpunk neon street, glowing purple/cyan, holograms, futuristic signs. Woman in reflective metallic jacket. Glowing animated realism, surreal yet hyper-real 3D finish.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e(00:11 – 00:15)\u003cbr\u003eAudio: Transition click → soft mystical Sufi vocals.\u003cbr\u003eVisuals: Same framing. Surreal desert night under starlit sky, glowing moon, whirling dervishes spinning in background. Woman wears flowing white-green attire. Dreamy cinematic textures, soft moonlight glow.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e(00:15 – 00:18)\u003cbr\u003eAudio: Transition click → sitar + tabla rhythms.\u003cbr\u003eVisuals: Same framing. Background now a temple courtyard, golden diyas glowing, carved arches. Sitar and tabla placed in scene. Woman in saree/fusion ethnic wear. Spiritual golden lighting, warm surreal realism.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e(00:18 – 00:21)\u003cbr\u003eAudio: Transition click → grand symphony swells.\u003cbr\u003eVisuals: Same framing. A European concert hall, chandeliers glowing, violins + piano in background. Woman in sleek black gown. Elegant lighting, cinematic atmosphere.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e(00:21 – 00:24)\u003cbr\u003eAudio: Transition click → upbeat pop chorus.\u003cbr\u003eVisuals: Same framing. A colorful pop music video world, confetti frozen mid-air, pastel pink/blue tones, dancers in background. Woman in vibrant pop-fashion. Hyper-realistic 3D textures, playful vibe.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e(00:24 – 00:27)\u003cbr\u003eAudio: All genres fuse → celebratory drop.\u003cbr\u003eVisuals: Same framing. Surreal fusion world: neon lights, confetti, crowd silhouettes, glowing temple lamps, cosmic sky blending together. Her outfit flashes between all styles then stabilizes into bold streetwear. Celebratory lighting, surreal hyper-real cinematic realism.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e(00:27 – 00:30)\u003cbr\u003eAudio: Music fades into a celebratory outro.\u003cbr\u003eVisuals: Background blurs smoothly. Screen fades to black. Spotify logo appears glowing at center in green/white. Below it, tagline text: “Spotify – Different worlds in just a click.” Minimalist, clean, cinematic end slide.\u003c/div\u003e","completed":false,"content":"Invideo Templates 「借用」：Spotify 品牌广告 @ Host Mode","starts_on":null,"due_on":null,"assignees":[{"id":611843,"attachable_sgid":"BAh7BkkiC19yYWlscwY6BkVUewdJIglkYXRhBjsAVEkiJ2dpZDovL2JjMy9QZXJzb24vNjExODQzP2V4cGlyZXNfaW4GOwBUSSIIcHVyBjsAVEkiD2F0dGFjaGFibGUGOwBU--0a352af23be50b1278562ef43580264eeade6f49","name":"hans","email_address":"hans@morechinese.cc",